==Battleground==
*1 [[Kory]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*2 [[Star Peng]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Kory]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Star Peng]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Kory]] spawns.
**2 [[Star Peng]]s spawn, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Cleanerbot Cat]], [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Rover Cat Mk II]] and tanky meatshields and big units to deal with the enemies. If you have [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]], don't use it often, as it dies like nothing and you may need the money; instead, try to summon it when other units seem to need help, especially [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]. Most [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Shield units]] other than Octopus Cat or [[Mightycat (Rare Cat)|Supercat]] will last much longer and most likely carry you through the stage, as long as you are able to protect them enough from the Star Pengs.

On crowned difficulties, if you have a [[Talents|Talented]] Awakened Bahamut Cat, you can cheese the stage by just bringing him. Bring [[Crazy Hearts (Combo)|Crazy Hearts]] or any other Starting Money UP (L) [[Cat Combo]], send him out once you have the money, and sit back and relax while Bahamut takes down all the enemies and the base.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Lesser Demon Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Greater Balrog Cat]]: Deals absurdly high damage, and there aren't many enemies to get in the way.
*[[Thunder Jack (Uber Rare Cat)|Thunder Jack]]: Can knockback the Star Pengs, allowing for other units to stop the Kories.
*[[Bora (Uber Rare Cat)|Bazibon]]: Can nuke the Star Pengs and deal massive damage whilst having resistance to them.
*[[Gravi (Uber Rare Cat)|Gravolo]]: Immune to waves and can tank the Star Pengs very well.

==Trivia==
*Cat Abduction's Japanese name, Cat Mutilation (キャットミューティレーション), is a reference to [[wikipedia:Cattle mutilation|cattle mutilation]], which has been attributed to [[:Category:Alien Enemies|aliens]] and [[wikipedia:Chupacabra|chupacabras]], the namesake of [[Chupacabra Love]].

